GPUI and gpui-kit (Apache-2.0)
  https://github.com/zed-industries/zed (GPUI), https://github.com/longbridge/gpui-kit
  The user interface is built on GPUI, the GPU-accelerated UI framework from
  the Zed editor, through the gpui-kit crate (which also bundles GPUI Component).

Zed agent delegation design (GPL-3.0-or-later) - https://github.com/zed-industries/zed
  Flint's subagent engine is an independent implementation of the observable
  spawn_agent behavior, not a copy of Zed's agent source. Reference revision:
  badfb8d31f2a03d0e3d996897bb93779003f4607, specifically
  crates/agent/src/tools/spawn_agent_tool.rs and crates/agent/src/thread.rs.
  No GPL-licensed source is bundled or linked into Flint's agent engine.

Agent Client Protocol (Apache-2.0) - https://agentclientprotocol.com
  crates/flint-acp speaks the Agent Client Protocol (through the
  agent-client-protocol crate) to run Claude Code and Codex through the
  claude-agent-acp and codex-acp adapters, and Droid through its native ACP
  server. Those adapters and the agents themselves are separate programs
  with their own licenses; flint does not bundle them.

